<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We must repent for the kingdom’s at hand;</l><l>All that we do, think, or feel, or have planned</l><l>Must be abandoned and changed in our mind;</l><l>Leave all the world and self-seeking behind.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All of religion has missed it again,</l><l>Teaching for doctrines the concepts of men;</l><l>They vainly wait for the kingdom to be.</l><l>A dispensation they’re hoping to see.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>But now the kingdom to us has been shown,</l><l>It is no less than our Jesus alone.</l><l>It is the Person of Christ in us all,</l><l>And it begins as a seed when we call.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
